@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.direction:Q{ck=~197:The sprite faces the viewer's right (east): the front/eye panel is turned toward the right edge or seen in right profile. It is not the south frame copied, and it is not another facing mislabelled.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~9:direction;so=[@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.0,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.1,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.2,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.3,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.4,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.5,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.6,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.7,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.8,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.9,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.10];wh=@actor}
@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.ground_line_measure:Q{ck=~193:Measured on the visible bounding box (zero-based, exclusive bottom/right): bottom == 28 (last opaque row 27, as the source) and |(left + right) / 2 - 16| <= 1 (source box [7,25) has centre 16).;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~19:ground_line_measure;so=[@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.0,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.1,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.2,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.3,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.4,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.5,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.6,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.7,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.8,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.9,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.10];wh=@actor}
