@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.identity:Q{ck=~426:Viewed at 1x and 3x nearest, the sprite reads as the same robot as assets/robot-base.png turned to face east: the dark navy rectangular frame, the rectangular antenna post(s) as visible from that facing (one post may hide the other in profile) at the same post height, the teal body panel, and the pale-yellow eyes where the facing shows the front. No added limbs, wheels, extra faces, text or other features, and no redesign.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~8:identity;so=[@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.0,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.1,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.2,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.3,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.4,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.5,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.6,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.7,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.8,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.9,@r.acf329804ba043b7.source.10];wh=@actor}
