@review.east.raw.01.verdict.2:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.2];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.alpha_binary;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~26:0 fractional-alpha pixels.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.3:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.3];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.palette_preserved;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~75:Only #25354a and #56b5bc occur; no colour outside the three source colours.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.4:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.4];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.identity;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~304:At 1x and 3x it reads as the same robot turned east: navy frame, one rectangular post visible in profile (the second hidden behind it) at the same height, the teal body panel visible edge-on as the 1-px front column, no eyes because the strict profile hides the front; no added limbs, wheels or features.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.5:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.5];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.proportions_volume;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~230:Same overall height and post height as south; reads as the same box turned 90 degrees (11 px deep); nothing stretched or squashed. The 1x2 bottom notch under the front edge is a minor artefact that does not change the read volume.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.6:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.6];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.height_measure;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~60:bbox top 3, bottom 28 (25 px); visible post rows 3-8 = 6 px.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.7:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.7];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.direction;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~118:The front (teal) edge is on the viewer's right, i.e. the robot faces east; not the south frame and not another facing.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.8:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.8];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.anchor_alignment;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~137:In the shared 32x32 cell beside south at 1x and 3x it stands on the same ground line and is centred like south; no visible jump or float.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
@review.east.raw.01.verdict.9:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.east.raw.01.evidence.9];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.east.ground_line_measure;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~60:bottom == 28; centre (11+22)/2 = 16.5, |16.5-16| = 0.5 <= 1.;xr=@candidate.east.raw}
