@review.west.edited.01.verdict.3:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.west.edited.01.evidence.3];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.west.palette_preserved;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~31:Only #25354a and #56b5bc occur.;xr=@candidate.west.edited}
@review.west.edited.01.verdict.4:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.west.edited.01.evidence.4];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.west.identity;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~342:Reads as the same robot turned west: navy frame, one rectangular post visible in profile at the same height, the teal body panel edge-on as the 1-px front column on the left, no eyes in strict profile; no added features. It is the exact mirror of the accepted east, which is the geometrically correct west of this left-right-symmetric design.;xr=@candidate.west.edited}
@review.west.edited.01.verdict.5:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.west.edited.01.evidence.5];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.west.proportions_volume;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~144:Same height, post height and box volume as east and south; nothing stretched or squashed (the mirrored 1x2 bottom notch is as minor as in east).;xr=@candidate.west.edited}
@review.west.edited.01.verdict.6:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.west.edited.01.evidence.6];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.west.height_measure;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~52:bbox top 3, bottom 28 (25 px); post rows 3-8 = 6 px.;xr=@candidate.west.edited}
@review.west.edited.01.verdict.7:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.west.edited.01.evidence.7];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.west.direction;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~133:The front (teal) edge is on the viewer's left, so the robot faces west; it is neither the south frame nor another facing mislabelled.;xr=@candidate.west.edited}
@review.west.edited.01.verdict.8:V{at=~25:2026-11-12T08:34:00+00:00;ev=[@review.west.edited.01.evidence.8];rq=@r.acf329804ba043b7.criterion.west.anchor_alignment;st=pass;tk=@r.acf329804ba043b7.task;wh=@actor;wy=~123:In the shared cell beside south at 1x and 3x it stands on the same ground line and is centred like south; no jump or float.;xr=@candidate.west.edited}
